findings.description:
The test changes only add `end_timestamp_precise` to existing fixtures. Nothing covers:

- eviction above 1000 spans, or which spans survive;
- `OptimizedCursorPaginator` (no reference in `tests/sentry/api/test_paginator.py`);
- the `optimized_pagination` endpoint branch.

A single endpoint test with one audit log entry would have caught both FAIL findings on the paginator.
